					<description><![CDATA[<strong>Material</strong>

PP, Fiberglass, Absorbent cotton.]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<h3><strong>Features</strong></h3>
<ul>
<li>Wire-wound filter cartridge is composed of textile fiber yarn tightly wound on the porous skeleton, which controls the winding density of the filter layer and the shape of the filter hole to form the filter cartridge with different filtering accuracy.</li>
<li>Can withstand high filtration pressure.</li>
<li>Can be made of a variety of materials to meet the needs of various liquid filtration.</li>
<li>The structure of the filter aperture is dense inside and sparse outside, with good deep filtering effect.</li>
<li>Can remove suspended solids and particles in the liquid, with small pressure drop and large contaminant capacity.</li>
</ul>
<hr />
<h3><strong>Applications</strong></h3>
<p>Electroplating, Mining, Machining, Petrochemical, Industrial water treatment.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
